#. comic32 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic32.htm:34
msgctxt "comic32#title.1"
msgid "\"BACK IN THE SADDLE AGAIN\""
msgstr ""

#. comic32 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic32.htm:71
msgctxt "comic32#p1.1"
msgid "Then one day, something different happens."
msgstr ""

#. comic32 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic32.htm:79
msgctxt "comic32#p1.2"
msgid "Finally, I'm back! That last void seemed to last forever!"
msgstr ""

#. comic32 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: raddready.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic32.htm:134
msgctxt "comic32#p2.1"
msgid "Man, I'm psyched! Time to rock!"
msgstr ""

#. comic32 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: raddstare.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic32.htm:238
msgctxt "comic32#p4.1"
msgid "Um, player? Any day now?..."
msgstr ""

#. comic33 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic33.htm:51
msgctxt "comic33#title.1"
msgid "\"ROOM TO MOVE\""
msgstr ""

#. comic33 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic33.htm:88
msgctxt "comic33#p1.1"
msgid "Radd finds himself unguided."
msgstr ""

#. comic33 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic33.htm:96
msgctxt "comic33#p1.2"
msgid "What's going on? Why aren't I moving?"
msgstr ""

#. comic33 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: raddwow.gif, bogeywalk2.gif
#: kidradd/comic33.htm:153
msgctxt "comic33#p2.1"
msgid "Oh no, a stray Bogey! C'mon player, aren't you gonna make me shoot or jump or something?"
msgstr ""

#. comic33 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: raddblink.gif, bogeystand2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic33.htm:206
msgctxt "comic33#p3.1"
msgid "How humiliating! I'm gonna lose a life to such a low level enemy."
msgstr ""

#. comic33 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: bogeytalk2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic33.htm:258
msgctxt "comic33#p4.1"
msgid "You know, you could just move by yourself."
msgstr ""

#. comic33 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddwow.gif, bogeysigh.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic33.htm:310
msgctxt "comic33#p5.1"
msgid "I can MOVE!!!"
msgstr ""

#. comic33 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddwow.gif, bogeysigh.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic33.htm:314
msgctxt "comic33#p5.2"
msgid "Hero sprites are so friggin' helpless without their players..."
msgstr ""

#. comic34 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic34.htm:34
msgctxt "comic34#title.1"
msgid "\"SHATTERED DREAMS\""
msgstr ""

#. comic34 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddsit.gif, bogeystand2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic34.htm:75
msgctxt "comic34#p1.1"
msgid "Okay, so I can move on my own, but do you think I should?"
msgstr ""

#. comic34 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddsit.gif, bogeystand2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic34.htm:79
msgctxt "comic34#p1.2"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. comic34 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddsit.gif, bogeytalk2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic34.htm:130
msgctxt "comic34#p2.1"
msgid "I mean, isn't it against the rules? The player's always directed my actions."
msgstr ""

#. comic34 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddsit.gif, bogeytalk2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic34.htm:134
msgctxt "comic34#p2.2"
msgid "The player? I hate to break it to you, but your player split ages ago."
msgstr ""

#. comic34 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: rheadwow.gif
#: kidradd/comic34.htm:184
msgctxt "comic34#p3.1"
msgid "The player's g, g - -<br></font><font size=\"5\" face=\"arial\"><b>GONE???</b></font>"
msgstr ""

#. comic34 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddsits.gif, bogeysigh2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic34.htm:235
msgctxt "comic34#p4.1"
msgid "You realize that you just destroyed my entire sense of purpose in life, right?"
msgstr ""

#. comic34 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddsits.gif, bogeysigh2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic34.htm:239
msgctxt "comic34#p4.2"
msgid "I'm a bad guy. It comes naturally."
msgstr ""

#. comic35 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic35.htm:34
msgctxt "comic35#title.1"
msgid "\"BRAIN DAMAGE\""
msgstr ""

#. comic35 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, bogeytalk2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic35.htm:75
msgctxt "comic35#p1.1"
msgid "How do you know the player's gone?"
msgstr ""

#. comic35 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, bogeytalk2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic35.htm:79
msgctxt "comic35#p1.2"
msgid "Technically I don't, but clues suggest that a different entity has seized control of our fate."
msgstr ""

#. comic35 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddwalk.gif, bogeywalk.gif, floor2walk.gif
#: kidradd/comic35.htm:134
msgctxt "comic35#p2.1"
msgid "The startup was instant rather than an uneven power surge, plus our processing speed is subtly different. We're not in our original system."
msgstr ""

#. comic35 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddwalk.gif, bogeywalk.gif, floor2walk.gif
#: kidradd/comic35.htm:182
msgctxt "comic35#p3.1"
msgid "Wow, I had no idea you Bogies were so smart."
msgstr ""

#. comic35 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddwalk.gif, bogeywalk.gif, floor2walk.gif
#: kidradd/comic35.htm:186
msgctxt "comic35#p3.2"
msgid "What, did you think we're stupid because we're drawn this way?"
msgstr ""

#. comic35 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, bogeymad2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic35.htm:235
msgctxt "comic35#p4.1"
msgid "No, I got that impression from the way you walk aimlessly into pits."
msgstr ""

#. comic35 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, bogeymad2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic35.htm:239
msgctxt "comic35#p4.2"
msgid "We're programmed to do that!"
msgstr ""

#. comic36 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic36.htm:34
msgctxt "comic36#title.1"
msgid "\"THE REFLEX\""
msgstr ""

#. comic36 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddwalk.gif, bogeywalk.gif, floor2walk.gif
#: kidradd/comic36.htm:79
msgctxt "comic36#p1.1"
msgid "We Bogeys aren't really evil, or even unfriendly. We're just another set of platform game drones programmed to do nothing but walk in straight lines."
msgstr ""

#. comic36 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddwalk.gif, bogeywalk.gif, floor2walk.gif
#: kidradd/comic36.htm:134
msgctxt "comic36#p2.1"
msgid "We don't \"attack\" the hero, we're just placed in inconvenient spots for the player. If we didn't have the \"touch of death,\" we'd be harmless."
msgstr ""

#. comic36 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, bogeystand.gif, bump.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic36.htm:182
msgctxt "comic36#p3.1"
msgid "But if you guys aren't stupid...<br>why do you...<br>well..."
msgstr ""

#. comic36 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, bogeysigh2.gif, bump.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic36.htm:235
msgctxt "comic36#p4.1"
msgid "Um, that's just a habit."
msgstr ""

#. comic36 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, bogeysigh2.gif, bump.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic36.htm:239
msgctxt "comic36#p4.2"
msgid "It's fun."
msgstr ""

#. comic37 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic37.htm:34
msgctxt "comic37#title.1"
msgid "\"I HAVE THE TOUCH\""
msgstr ""

#. comic37 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: bogeysigh.gif, raddstand.gif, bump.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic37.htm:75
msgctxt "comic37#p1.1"
msgid "So, can I help you guys outta there?"
msgstr ""

#. comic37 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: bogeysigh.gif, raddstand.gif, bump.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic37.htm:79
msgctxt "comic37#p1.2"
msgid "Thanks, but you can't."
msgstr ""

#. comic37 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, bump.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic37.htm:130
msgctxt "comic37#p2.1"
msgid "Why not?"
msgstr ""

#. comic37 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, bump.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic37.htm:134
msgctxt "comic37#p2.2"
msgid "Cuz you're the game's hero, and we're enemy sprites. Touching us hurts you."
msgstr ""

#. comic37 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, bump.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic37.htm:182
msgctxt "comic37#p3.1"
msgid "But it's not like you're attacking me - -"
msgstr ""

#. comic37 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, bump.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic37.htm:186
msgctxt "comic37#p3.2"
msgid "Doesn't matter. You can't touch us without hurting yourself."
msgstr ""

#. comic37 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: bogeymad2.gif, raddblink.gif, bump.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic37.htm:235
msgctxt "comic37#p4.1"
msgid "But... <b>WHY?</b>"
msgstr ""

#. comic37 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: bogeymad2.gif, raddblink.gif, bump.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic37.htm:237
msgctxt "comic37#p4.2"
msgid "Touch of death, man. Touch of death."
msgstr ""

#. comic37 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: bogeymad2.gif, raddblink.gif, bump.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic37.htm:239
msgctxt "comic37#p4.3"
msgid "We bad."
msgstr ""

#. comic38 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic38.htm:51
msgctxt "comic38#title.1"
msgid "\"STARTING OVER\""
msgstr ""

#. comic38 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddsit2.gif, bogeystand.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic38.htm:92
msgctxt "comic38#p1.1"
msgid "Do you think the player's gone for good?"
msgstr ""

#. comic38 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddsit2.gif, bogeystand.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic38.htm:96
msgctxt "comic38#p1.2"
msgid "Couldn't say."
msgstr ""

#. comic38 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddsit2.gif, bogeymad.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic38.htm:149
msgctxt "comic38#p2.1"
msgid "So what happens now? Do we keep playing the game?"
msgstr ""

#. comic38 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddsit2.gif, bogeymad.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic38.htm:153
msgctxt "comic38#p2.2"
msgid "Hmph. I'd prefer not to."
msgstr ""

#. comic38 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddsit2.gif, bogeystand.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic38.htm:202
msgctxt "comic38#p3.1"
msgid "I guess life's gonna be a lot simpler from now on."
msgstr ""

#. comic38 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddsit2.gif, bogeystand.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic38.htm:258
msgctxt "comic38#p4.1"
msgid "Ta-daaaaa!!!"
msgstr ""

#. comic38 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddsit2.gif, bogeystand.gif, qbtalk2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic38.htm:308
msgctxt "comic38#p5.1"
msgid "Spoke too soon, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. comic38 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: raddsit2.gif, bogeystand.gif, qbtalk2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic38.htm:310
msgctxt "comic38#p5.2"
msgid "Yep."
msgstr ""

#. comic38 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddsit2.gif, bogeystand.gif, qbtalk2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic38.htm:312
msgctxt "comic38#p5.3"
msgid "I'm here! You're saved!"
msgstr ""

#. comic39 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic39.htm:36
msgctxt "comic39#title.1"
msgid "\"BREAKING UP IS HARD TO DO\""
msgstr ""

#. comic39 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, bogeystand.gif, qbtalk2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic39.htm:77
msgctxt "comic39#p1.1"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr ""

#. comic39 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, bogeystand.gif, qbtalk2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic39.htm:81
msgctxt "comic39#p1.2"
msgid "I'm Captain QB, of the Moderators. I'm here to set you free!"
msgstr ""

#. comic39 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, bogeystand.gif, qbtalk2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic39.htm:134
msgctxt "comic39#p2.1"
msgid "Uh, free from what?"
msgstr ""

#. comic39 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, bogeystand.gif, qbtalk2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic39.htm:138
msgctxt "comic39#p2.2"
msgid "This game, of course."
msgstr ""

#. comic39 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, bogeystand.gif, qbstand2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic39.htm:186
msgctxt "comic39#p3.1"
msgid "Did the player send you?"
msgstr ""

#. comic39 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, bogeystand.gif, qbstand2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic39.htm:190
msgctxt "comic39#p3.2"
msgid "The what? Geez, no. Your player's long gone."
msgstr ""

#. comic39 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: rheadwow.gif
#: kidradd/comic39.htm:240
msgctxt "comic39#p4.1"
msgid "NOOOOOOO!!!!!"
msgstr ""

#. comic39 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddsits2.gif, bogeysigh.gif, qbstand2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic39.htm:290
msgctxt "comic39#p5.1"
msgid "Why, oh why?..."
msgstr ""

#. comic39 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: raddsits2.gif, bogeysigh.gif, qbstand2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic39.htm:292
msgctxt "comic39#p5.2"
msgid "He's a little codependent."
msgstr ""

#. comic39 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddsits2.gif, bogeysigh.gif, qbstand2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic39.htm:294
msgctxt "comic39#p5.3"
msgid "I hate it when they're like that."
msgstr ""

#. comic40 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic40.htm:36
msgctxt "comic40#title.1"
msgid "\"TIME AFTER TIME\""
msgstr ""

#. comic40 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, qbtalk2.gif, bogeystand2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic40.htm:77
msgctxt "comic40#p1.1"
msgid "But, where did my player go?"
msgstr ""

#. comic40 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, qbtalk2.gif, bogeystand2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic40.htm:81
msgctxt "comic40#p1.2"
msgid "Who knows? He got bored with you and left you out of play for years."
msgstr ""

#. comic40 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, qbtalk2.gif, bogeystand2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic40.htm:134
msgctxt "comic40#p2.1"
msgid "But, why are we here? Doesn't that mean the player's back if we're here?"
msgstr ""

#. comic40 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, qbtalk2.gif, bogeystand2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic40.htm:138
msgctxt "comic40#p2.2"
msgid "Not exactly..."
msgstr ""

#. comic40 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: qbhead.gif
#: kidradd/comic40.htm:188
msgctxt "comic40#p3.1"
msgid "We're not in your original game cartridge. This is what's called a \"ROM.\" In simplest terms, someone copied your game into a file and put it on the web."
msgstr ""

#. comic40 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, qbtalk.gif, bogeysigh2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic40.htm:238
msgctxt "comic40#p4.1"
msgid "What's the web?"
msgstr ""

#. comic40 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, qbtalk.gif, bogeysigh2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic40.htm:240
msgctxt "comic40#p4.2"
msgid "This is a pretty old game, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. comic40 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, qbtalk.gif, bogeysigh2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic40.htm:242
msgctxt "comic40#p4.3"
msgid "Circa 1987."
msgstr ""

#. comic41 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic41.htm:36
msgctxt "comic41#title.1"
msgid "\"GOTTA BE ME\""
msgstr ""

#. comic41 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: qbhead.gif
#: kidradd/comic41.htm:79
msgctxt "comic41#p1.1"
msgid "So anyways, the Moderators detected a new ROM on the web, and sent me to free you guys before other players start downloading you."
msgstr ""

#. comic41 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, qbtalk2.gif, bogeystand2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic41.htm:134
msgctxt "comic41#p2.1"
msgid "Is that painful?"
msgstr ""

#. comic41 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, qbtalk2.gif, bogeystand2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic41.htm:138
msgctxt "comic41#p2.2"
msgid "For you, no. But each download creates a new copy of you that will be subjected to the tortures of the game by another player."
msgstr ""

#. comic41 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: rhead.gif
#: kidradd/comic41.htm:188
msgctxt "comic41#p3.1"
msgid "Bogus! Can you imagine? I don't want there to be thousands of identical copies of me!"
msgstr ""

#. comic41 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddwow.gif, qbtalk2.gif, bogeysigh2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic41.htm:238
msgctxt "comic41#p4.1"
msgid "Actually, you're a video game character, so there's already tons of copies of..."
msgstr ""

#. comic41 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddwow.gif, qbtalk2.gif, bogeysigh2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic41.htm:242
msgctxt "comic41#p4.2"
msgid "No, better not shock him anymore today."
msgstr ""

#. comic42 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic42.htm:52
msgctxt "comic42#title.1"
msgid "\"FREEZEFRAME\""
msgstr ""

#. comic42 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: qbstand2.gif, bogeytalk2.gif, raddblink.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic42.htm:93
msgctxt "comic42#p1.1"
msgid "So, are you ready to leave?"
msgstr ""

#. comic42 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: qbstand2.gif, bogeytalk2.gif, raddblink.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic42.htm:95
msgctxt "comic42#p1.2"
msgid "Sure, let's go."
msgstr ""

#. comic42 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: qbstand2.gif, bogeytalk2.gif, raddblink.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic42.htm:97
msgctxt "comic42#p1.3"
msgid "W - wait..."
msgstr ""

#. comic42 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: rhead.gif
#: kidradd/comic42.htm:152
msgctxt "comic42#p2.1"
msgid "I've spent my whole life here... and the outside world, whatever that's like, sounds rather frightening. I need to think this over."
msgstr ""

#. comic42 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: bogeystand.gif, qbstand.gif, raddstand2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic42.htm:203
msgctxt "comic42#p3.1"
msgid "Truthfully, you don't have a choice in the matter."
msgstr ""

#. comic42 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: bogeystand.gif, qbstand.gif, raddstand2.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic42.htm:207
msgctxt "comic42#p3.2"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. comic42 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: bogeystand.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic42.htm:255
msgctxt "comic42#p4.1"
msgid "Super Freezeplay DX!"
msgstr ""

#. comic42 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: bogeytalk.gif, qbstand2.gif, rblue.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic42.htm:309
msgctxt "comic42#p5.1"
msgid "Cool, do it again!"
msgstr ""

#. comic42 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: bogeytalk.gif, qbstand2.gif, rblue.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic42.htm:313
msgctxt "comic42#p5.2"
msgid "Don't worry, I'm sure I will..."
msgstr ""

#. comic43 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic43.htm:36
msgctxt "comic43#title.1"
msgid "\"THE DAY AFTER\""
msgstr ""

#. comic43 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: rheadack.gif
#: kidradd/comic43.htm:79
msgctxt "comic43#p1.1"
msgid "Oogh... Where am I?"
msgstr ""

#. comic43 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddsits.gif, qbtalk2.gif, bogeystand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic43.htm:138
msgctxt "comic43#p2.1"
msgid "Sorry, we had to forcefully detain those who wouldn't leave willfully."
msgstr ""

#. comic43 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddmad.gif, qbstand2.gif, bogeystand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic43.htm:186
